Third-party notices for rt-script-engine.wasm
=============================================

rt-script-engine.wasm, the script engine of RequestTailor, is built from the glue in
src/engine.c (Apache-2.0, The RequestTailor Authors) and the following third-party works,
compiled to WebAssembly with wasi-sdk (versions and checksums in engine.json):

- QuickJS-ng (MIT), including Unicode data tables (Unicode License v3)
- wasi-libc, statically linked (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception OR Apache-2.0 OR MIT), with
  parts from musl (MIT), cloudlibc (BSD-2-Clause) and dlmalloc (CC0-1.0)
- the compiler-rt builtins of LLVM (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception)

Their notices follow.

